 ## Operating characteristics
-- **Time Complexity:** $O(N)$ where $N$ is the number of voxels, as each voxel is processed once. Hash map operations are $O(1)$ on average.
-- **Memory Complexity:** $O(V)$ where $V$ is the number of vertices, proportional to the number of voxels with sign changes.
