-- **Strengths:** Simple implementation, fast, no complex solver required.
-- **Limitations:** Vertices are fixed at cell centers, leading to potential geometric inaccuracies. Topology is not guaranteed to be manifold or correct in complex cases. Face orientation depends on strict basis vector ordering.
