 ## Background
-Simplified Dual Contouring is an unfinished attempt at general-purpose dual-contouring isosurface extraction, as described in an unofficial GitHub repository [S1, unofficial]. It references tutorials and blogs from 2016-2018 [S1, unofficial]. The method is presented as a simpler alternative to full Dual Contouring, omitting the QEF minimization step.
